    {"role": "assistant", "text": "Zero-downtime model updates on K8s require careful orchestration. Here's the production-hardened approach:\n\n**Rolling update with readiness probes:**\n\n```yaml\n# deployment.yaml\nstrategy:\n  type: RollingUpdate\n  rollingUpdate:\n    maxSurge: 25%        # Bring up 25% new pods before killing old\n    maxUnavailable: 0%   # Never go below desired capacity\n\nreadinessProbe:\n  httpGet:\n    path: /ready\n    port: 8080\n  initialDelaySeconds: 30  # Time to load model\n  periodSeconds: 5\n  failureThreshold: 3\n\nlivenessProbe:\n  httpGet:\n    path: /health  \n  initialDelaySeconds: 60\n  periodSeconds: 15\n```\n\n**The readiness endpoint is critical:**\n```python\n@app.get('/ready')\nasync def ready():\n    # Only return 200 when model AND FAISS index are fully loaded\n    if model_loaded and faiss_index_loaded and redis_connected:\n        return {'status': 'ready'}\n    raise HTTPException(503, 'Not ready')\n```\n\nK8s won't route traffic to a pod until /ready returns 200. During model loading (which may take 30-60 seconds), the pod is excluded from the load balancer.\n\n**PodDisruptionBudget for safety:**\n```yaml\napiVersion: policy/v1\nkind: PodDisruptionBudget\nspec:\n  minAvailable: 80%  # Always keep 80% of pods running\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: inference-server\n```\n\n**Model version management:**\nStore models in S3 with semantic versioning: `s3://models/recommendation/v2.3.1/model.tar.gz`\n\nThe Deployment manifest references a ConfigMap with the model version:\n```python\nMODEL_VERSION = os.environ['MODEL_VERSION']  # injected at deploy time\nmodel_path = f's3://models/recommendation/{MODEL_VERSION}/'\n```\n\nUpdating the model = updating the ConfigMap + rolling restart. This gives you full version history and easy rollback:\n```bash\n# Rollback to previous version\nkubectl rollout undo deployment/inference-server\n```\n\n**GitOps with ArgoCD:**\nCommit model version to Git → ArgoCD detects change → triggers rolling update → monitors rollout health → alerts on failure. Full audit trail.", "index": 15},
